## Throne

::bg{location="throne" time="night"}
::music{playback="stop"}
@regent{code="0010"}: Little heir. Little drowned heir. You think the crown is a prize.
@ilo{code="0010"}: I think it's mine.
@regent{code="0020"}: It was mine. It was my father's. It will be yours, and it will drown you slower than the sea did.
@narrator{code="0010"}: The Regent's body unwinds into current, and the current goes still.
